shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, par value $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare_iI_pid_c20240603__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_zEg8YIjXsxd6"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-03_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact000559" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.01</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, at an offering price of $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_pid_c20240603__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_zEOPRmPxnd43"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-03_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact000560" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">1.50</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, for aggregate gross proceeds
of approximately $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement_pn3n3_c20240603__20240603__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember_zXMRB852EOX9"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" contextRef="From2024-06-032024-06-03_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember" id="Fact000561" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">2,350</ix:nonFraction></span> before deducting the placement agent fee and related offering expenses of approximately $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DeferredOfferingCosts_iI_pn3n3_c20240603__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember_zgSJlTKpLR9b"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DeferredOfferingCosts" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-03_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember" id="Fact000562" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">328</ix:nonFraction></span>. In a concurrent
private placement, the Company agreed to issue to the investors series F preferred investment options to purchase up to <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_pid_c20240603__20240603__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesFPreferredInvestmentOptionsMember_zWL3t7Ecj1m8"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2024-06-032024-06-03_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SeriesFPreferredInvestmentOptionsMember" id="Fact000563" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,133,338</ix:nonFraction></span> shares
of common stock at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_pid_c20240603__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesFPreferredInvestmentOptionsMember_z7GahKVHIBy2"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-03_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SeriesFPreferredInvestmentOptionsMember" id="Fact000564" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">1.50</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. Each Series F preferred investment option is exercisable immediately and will
expire two years from the initial exercise date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company also issued to Wainwright or its designees preferred investment options to purchase up to <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_pid_c20240603__20240603__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--HCWainwrightAndCoLLCMember_zZlXUqG1wjRa"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2024-06-032024-06-03_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_HCWainwrightAndCoLLCMember" id="Fact000565" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">78,333</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock which
have the same terms as investors&#8217; preferred investment options except for an exercise price equal to $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_pid_c20240603__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--HCWainwrightAndCoLLCMember_ztalVlQB2LTg"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-03_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_HCWainwrightAndCoLLCMember" id="Fact000566" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">1.875</ix:nonFraction></span> per share.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
