<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span><span id="xdx_8B3_zUrOJ9WqEDlf" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF WARRANTS OUTSTANDING</span></p>

